u$ and $\Xi_{cc}^{0,++}ightarrow\Xi_{c}^{0}l^{+}
u$. The results showed that the rates of these decays are significantly higher than those of $\Xi_{c}^{0,+,b}ightarrow\Xi_{c}^{0,+,b}l^{+}
u$ and that the primary decay modes of $\Xi_{cc}^{++}$ and $\Xi_{cc}^{0}$ are $\Xi_{cc}^{0,0}ightarrow\Xi_{c}^{0}D^{+}$ and $\Xi_{cc}^{0,0}ightarrow\Xi_{c}^{0}D^{0}$.
